<title>SWEDEN: TABLE - ASSIDOMAN H1 PROFIT FALLS 30 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ASSIDOMAN H1 PROFIT FALLS 30 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group reported its results for the six months ending June 30, 1997, on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		    859 vs   1,229</p>
<p> Turnover				   10,136 vs   9,707</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)		5.20  vs   7.55</p>
<p> Other operating income		    219 vs     524</p>
<p> Operating costs			   8,638 vs   8,373</p>
<p> Depreciation				  698 vs     572</p>
<p> Associate interests	    CREDIT     5 vs	10 CHARGE</p>
<p> Operating profit			  1,024 vs   1,276</p>
<p> Net financial items	    CHARGE   165 vs	47 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax					     240 vs     334</p>
<p> Minorities					1 vs     nil</p>
<p> Net profit				    618 vs     895</p>
<p>NOTE -- A Reuters poll found AssiDoman was expected to post a profit after financial items of 819 million crowns for the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
